<h2>Introduction to Philosophy</h2>
<p>An inquiry into the ideas that shaped the Western philosophical tradition</p>
</div>
<img src="/phil1301/assets/images/aristtophalf-copy.jpg" alt="Rembrandt van Rijn, Aristotle with a Bust of Homer, 1653. Aristotle, dressed in rich Renaissance costume, rests his hand on a marble bust of Homer and gazes into the middle distance." width="860" height="380" loading="lazy" class="page-hero-image">
