<p>Welcome to Introduction to Philosophy. This course is an invitation to think carefully about some of the most fundamental questions human beings have ever asked — about knowledge, reality, morality, history, and freedom — through the writings of six philosophers whose work has shaped the way we still think about these problems today.</p>
<p>Use the navigation below to move through the course. If you are new here, begin with <strong>Start Here!</strong> before anything else.</p>
